"Authenticator Transports allowed by the application. Authenticators can "
"interact with the user web browser through several transports. Applications "
"may want to restrict the transport protocols for extra security hardening "
"reasons. By default, all transports should be allowed. If your application "
"is to be used by mobile phone users, you may want to restrict only the "
"`INTERNAL` authenticator to be allowed. Permitted values are:\n"
